# Configuration and Deployment

## Configuration Management
- Main configuration is in [config.yaml.example](mdc:config.yaml.example)
- Use YAML format for human-readable configuration
- Support environment variable overrides
- Validate configuration at startup

## Docker Support
- Primary Dockerfile in [Dockerfile](mdc:Dockerfile)
- Development Dockerfile in [lxp_bridge_dev/Dockerfile](mdc:lxp_bridge_dev/Dockerfile)
- Use multi-stage builds for optimized images
- Support both development and production builds

## Docker Compose
- Example compose file in [docker-compose.yaml.example](mdc:docker-compose.yaml.example)
- Configure networking for inverter communication
- Set up MQTT broker integration
- Include health checks and monitoring

## Systemd Integration
- Service file in [systemd/lxp-bridge.service](mdc:systemd/lxp-bridge.service)
- Configure proper user permissions
- Set up logging and restart policies
- Handle signal management

## Environment Configuration
- Use environment variables for sensitive data
- Support different configuration profiles
- Validate required configuration values
- Provide helpful error messages for missing config
